        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In Strood, England, a company called Cocoba built something amazing—a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "huge",
            "zh": "巨大的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " chocolate egg! It "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "weighs",
            "ref": "v-weigh"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " 300 kilogrammes, as much as three grown people."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "idea",
            "ref": "v-idea"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " came from a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "customer",
            "zh": "顾客"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " who said, “You should think bigger!” So five workers "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "spent",
            "zh": "花费"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " five days making it. They called it the Good Egg Project."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "After Easter, the giant egg will be "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "melted",
            "zh": "融化"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " down and turned into many chocolate "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "bars",
            "ref": "v-bar"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Cocoba will sell them to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "raise",
            "ref": "v-raise"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " money for local "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "charities",
            "zh": "当地的慈善机构"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that help people in need."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Darren Litton, the founder of Cocoba, said, “We had great fun bringing the egg to life.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Everyone at the shop was proud to see their sweet "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "creation",
            "ref": "v-creation"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The big chocolate egg shows how "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "teamwork",
            "ref": "v-teamwork"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "—and a love of chocolate—can make something truly special."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
